sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    U->>B: Enter username/password
    B->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    A->>D: Validate user + password hash
    D-->>A: User record
    A->>D: Create hashed opaque session
    A-->>B: Set HttpOnly Secure session cookie + CSRF token
    B->>A: Authenticated request + CSRF for mutation
    A->>D: Validate active session + permissions
    D-->>A: Session/user context
    A-->>B: Response
